  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Call to Action on Protection from Gender-Based Violence in Emergencies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ad-hoc secretariat for the Norwegian chairmanship 2025-26 of the Call to Action on Protection from Gender-Based Violence in Emergencies. The secretariat will draft an annual report based on members&apos; contributions, recruitment and manage a consultant to lead the development and drafting of a new Road Map, prepare for the annul partners meeting in Oslo, support the Steering Committee, manage events to enhance the profile of the Call to Action, finalize the governance structure and management of membership application backlogs and maintain the website.</narrative>
  </description>
